      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Use of side-biting clamps in patients with coronary artery disease and atheromatous disease of ascending aorta, undergoing coronary artery surgery can lead to major postoperative neurological events. We describe the use of a simple device to avoid use of side-biting clamp on aorta for proximal aortocoronary anastomosis."},
